SUVIDHA – Hackathon PRD (Lean Version)
Version: 1.0
Date: Jan 28, 2026
Team: SUVIDHA

1. Problem
Citizens face long queues, language barriers, and poor transparency in civic utility services (electricity, gas, water, municipal).

2. Solution
A smart self-service kiosk enabling Aadhaar-based login, bill payments, complaint registration, and status tracking with multilingual support.

3. Target Users
- Citizens (18–70 years)
- Utility staff (monitoring)
- Admins (kiosk & complaint management)

4. Core Features (Hackathon Scope)
P0:
- Aadhaar + OTP authentication
- Multilingual UI (English, Hindi, Kannada)
- View & pay utility bills
- Complaint registration
- Receipt generation
- Secure session management

P1:
- Complaint status tracking
- Admin dashboard (basic stats)

5. User Flow
Language Select → Aadhaar Login → Dashboard → 
(Pay Bill / Register Complaint / Track Status) → Receipt → Auto Logout

6. Tech Stack
Frontend: React, Tailwind, i18next  
Backend: Node.js, Express  
DB: PostgreSQL (Prisma)  
Payments: Razorpay (sandbox)  
Auth: OTP (mock Aadhaar)

7. Success Metrics
- < 3 min per transaction
- 95%+ payment success
- Multilingual usability validated by judges

8. Out of Scope
- Mobile app
- IoT / Smart meters
- Advanced analytics
- Biometric auth

9. Demo Plan
- Simulated Aadhaar login
- Live bill payment (sandbox)
- Register & track a complaint
- Show admin dashboard stats

10. Future Scope
Voice navigation, DigiLocker, AI chatbot, more languages
